to compile and link the thing, with g77 under RedHat 6.0, without any fatal
errors, but it doesn't get far when I execute the binary, sadly. It falls over
when trying to parse the route card in l1.exe; as far as I can tell this is
because it's overwritten the stack at some point (I've tried running it 
through gdb, but the debugger doesn't trap any fatal signals - the program
just "appears" to have exited normally).
	The compilation was fairly straightforward - I used a modified
