Check out one of the many Jensen Linux howtos, such as:
(the original)
ftp://ftp.digital.com/pub/digital/Linux-Alpha/JENSEN_INSTALL/Jensen-HOWT
O
(and later)
http://www.home.unix-ag.org/nils/Alpha/Architectures/Jensen_install.html
