it seems you have a bad block on the hd.  or...  the scsi terminator went
bad.

depending on when the bus errors happen you can recover.  usually during
scsi write's if the drive runs across a bad sector or whatever it'll map it
out and write somewhere else.  reads on the other hand are doomed.

i would try the terminators first. or format with bad block checking.

just a thought.

