On Tue, 14 Sep 1999 15:59:47 -0400, "RICARDO J YANES"
<RYANES@prodigy.net> wrote:

>Hi i just got an multia 166mhz and an ide harddisk but when it doesn't boot
>milo from the arc frimware why? i did the upgrade to the new firmmare etc.Is
>there another way to boot linux without the floppy?
>
